[{"id":"kashafa-43-50-1","words":["verb:kashafa"],"options":[{"bs":"otklonili smo","en":"We removed"},{"bs":"otklonio je","en":"he/it removed"},{"bs":"otkloni","en":"remove"},{"bs":"i otkrila je","en":"and she/it uncovered"}],"ref":"43:50","answerWord":"كَشَفْنَا","answerSound":"audio/92bc74c7cbf7d132adeb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But when We eased them of the torment, behold! they broke their word.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"otkloniti, otkriti","en":"to remove, to uncover"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","كَشَفْنَا","عَنْهُمُ","ٱلْعَذَابَ","إِذَا","هُمْ","يَنكُثُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"كَشَفَ"}},{"id":"kashafa-21-84-2","words":["verb:kashafa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo otklonili","en":"so we removed"},{"bs":"otklonio si","en":"you removed"},{"bs":"otklonio je","en":"he/it removed"},{"bs":"biva otkriven","en":"he/it is uncovered"}],"ref":"21:84","answerWord":"فَكَشَفْنَا","answerSound":"audio/2b333d9842ce656692c4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then We heard his prayer and removed that adversity from which he suffered, and We gave him his household (that he had lost) and the like thereof along with them, a mercy from Our store, and a remembrance for the worshippers;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"otkloniti, otkriti","en":"to remove, to uncover"},"passage":["فَٱسْتَجَبْنَا","لَهُۥ","فَكَشَفْنَا","مَا","بِهِۦ","مِن","ضُرٍّ","وَءَاتَيْنَٰهُ","أَهْلَهُۥ","وَمِثْلَهُم","مَّعَهُمْ","رَحْمَةً","مِّنْ","عِندِنَا","وَذِكْرَىٰ","لِلْعَٰبِدِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"كَشَفَ"}},{"id":"kashafa-6-41-3","words":["verb:kashafa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa On otkloni","en":"and He removes"},{"bs":"i otklonili smo","en":"and we removed"},{"bs":"otkloni","en":"remove"},{"bs":"otklonio je","en":"he/it removed"}],"ref":"6:41","answerWord":"فَيَكْشِفُ","answerSound":"audio/f6a3cf36354b5a9a2ede.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, but unto Him ye call, and He removeth that because of which ye call unto Him, if He will, and ye forget whatever partners ye ascribed unto Him.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"otkloniti, otkriti","en":"to remove, to uncover"},"passage":["بَلْ","إِيَّاهُ","تَدْعُونَ","فَيَكْشِفُ","مَا","تَدْعُونَ","إِلَيْهِ","إِن","شَآءَ","وَتَنسَوْنَ","مَا","تُشْرِكُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"كَشَفَ"}},{"id":"kashafa-7-134-13","words":["verb:kashafa"],"options":[{"bs":"otklonio si","en":"you removed"},{"bs":"pa On otkloni","en":"and He removes"},{"bs":"pa smo otklonili","en":"so we removed"},{"bs":"otklonio je","en":"he/it removed"}],"ref":"7:134","answerWord":"كَشَفْتَ","answerSound":"audio/0419a66670b7066eac5d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when the terror fell on them they cried: O Moses! Pray for us unto thy Lord, because He hath a covenant with thee. If thou removest the terror from us we verily will trust thee and will let the Children of Israel go with thee.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"otkloniti, otkriti","en":"to remove, to uncover"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","وَقَعَ","عَلَيْهِمُ","ٱلرِّجْزُ","قَالُوا۟","يَٰمُوسَى","ٱدْعُ","لَنَا","رَبَّكَ","بِمَا","عَهِدَ","عِندَكَ","لَئِن","كَشَفْتَ","عَنَّا","ٱلرِّجْزَ","لَنُؤْمِنَنَّ","لَكَ","وَلَنُرْسِلَنَّ","مَعَكَ","بَنِىٓ","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"كَشَفَ"}},{"id":"kashafa-16-54-2","words":["verb:kashafa"],"options":[{"bs":"otklonio je","en":"he/it removed"},{"bs":"pa On otkloni","en":"and He removes"},{"bs":"i otkrila je","en":"and she/it uncovered"},{"bs":"i otklonili smo","en":"and we removed"}],"ref":"16:54","answerWord":"كَشَفَ","answerSound":"audio/dbad03cc269bbbefdb42.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And afterward, when He hath rid you of the misfortune, behold! a set of you attribute partners to their Lord,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"otkloniti, otkriti","en":"to remove, to uncover"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","إِذَا","كَشَفَ","ٱلضُّرَّ","عَنكُمْ","إِذَا","فَرِيقٌ","مِّنكُم","بِرَبِّهِمْ","يُشْرِكُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"كَشَفَ"}},{"id":"kashafa-23-75-2","words":["verb:kashafa"],"options":[{"bs":"i otklonili smo","en":"and we removed"},{"bs":"pa On otkloni","en":"and He removes"},{"bs":"biva otkriven","en":"he/it is uncovered"},{"bs":"otkloni","en":"remove"}],"ref":"23:75","answerWord":"وَكَشَفْنَا","answerSound":"audio/30f77e6690f0ac5c934e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Though We had mercy on them and relieved them of the harm afflicting them, they still would wander blindly on in their contumacy.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"otkloniti, otkriti","en":"to remove, to uncover"},"passage":["وَلَوْ","رَحِمْنَٰهُمْ","وَكَشَفْنَا","مَا","بِهِم","مِّن","ضُرٍّ","لَّلَجُّوا۟","فِى","طُغْيَٰنِهِمْ","يَعْمَهُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"كَشَفَ"}},{"id":"kashafa-27-44-8","words":["verb:kashafa"],"options":[{"bs":"i otkrila je","en":"and she/it uncovered"},{"bs":"pa smo otklonili","en":"so we removed"},{"bs":"pa On otkloni","en":"and He removes"},{"bs":"biva otkriven","en":"he/it is uncovered"}],"ref":"27:44","answerWord":"وَكَشَفَتْ","answerSound":"audio/f65eb72e400392ec3252.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It was said unto her: Enter the hall. And when she saw it she deemed it a pool and bared her legs. (Solomon) said: Lo! it is a hall, made smooth, of glass. She said: My Lord! Lo! I have wronged myself, and I surrender with Solomon unto Allah, the Lord of the Worlds.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"otkloniti, otkriti","en":"to remove, to uncover"},"passage":["قِيلَ","لَهَا","ٱدْخُلِى","ٱلصَّرْحَ","فَلَمَّا","رَأَتْهُ","حَسِبَتْهُ","لُجَّةً","وَكَشَفَتْ","عَن","سَاقَيْهَا","قَالَ","إِنَّهُۥ","صَرْحٌ","مُّمَرَّدٌ","مِّن","قَوَارِيرَ","قَالَتْ","رَبِّ","إِنِّى","ظَلَمْتُ","نَفْسِى","وَأَسْلَمْتُ","مَعَ","سُلَيْمَٰنَ","لِلَّهِ","رَبِّ","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"كَشَفَ"}},{"id":"kashafa-27-62-5","words":["verb:kashafa"],"options":[{"bs":"i otklanja","en":"and he/it removes"},{"bs":"otkloni","en":"remove"},{"bs":"i otklonili smo","en":"and we removed"},{"bs":"otklonio je","en":"he/it removed"}],"ref":"27:62","answerWord":"وَيَكْشِفُ","answerSound":"audio/ddcdaef2ee56b436e480.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Is not He (best) Who answereth the wronged one when he crieth unto Him and removeth the evil, and hath made you viceroys of the earth? Is there any Allah beside Allah? Little do they reflect!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"otkloniti, otkriti","en":"to remove, to uncover"},"passage":["أَمَّن","يُجِيبُ","ٱلْمُضْطَرَّ","إِذَا","دَعَاهُ","وَيَكْشِفُ","ٱلسُّوٓءَ","وَيَجْعَلُكُمْ","خُلَفَآءَ","ٱلْأَرْضِ","أَءِلَٰهٌ","مَّعَ","ٱللَّهِ","قَلِيلًا","مَّا","تَذَكَّرُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"كَشَفَ"}},{"id":"kashafa-44-12-1","words":["verb:kashafa"],"options":[{"bs":"otkloni","en":"remove"},{"bs":"biva otkriven","en":"he/it is uncovered"},{"bs":"pa smo otklonili","en":"so we removed"},{"bs":"i otkrila je","en":"and she/it uncovered"}],"ref":"44:12","answerWord":"ٱكْشِفْ","answerSound":"audio/e06e5b7ae8d0cc7d77ce.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Then they will say): Our Lord relieve us of the torment. Lo! we are believers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"otkloniti, otkriti","en":"to remove, to uncover"},"passage":["رَّبَّنَا","ٱكْشِفْ","عَنَّا","ٱلْعَذَابَ","إِنَّا","مُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"كَشَفَ"}},{"id":"kashafa-68-42-1","words":["verb:kashafa"],"options":[{"bs":"biva otkriven","en":"he/it is uncovered"},{"bs":"pa smo otklonili","en":"so we removed"},{"bs":"otkloni","en":"remove"},{"bs":"i otkrila je","en":"and she/it uncovered"}],"ref":"68:42","answerWord":"يُكْشَفُ","answerSound":"audio/88c3ef2cd017ea5d271d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"On the day when it befalleth in earnest, and they are ordered to prostrate themselves but are not able,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"otkloniti, otkriti","en":"to remove, to uncover"},"passage":["يَوْمَ","يُكْشَفُ","عَن","سَاقٍ","وَيُدْعَوْنَ","إِلَى","ٱلسُّجُودِ","فَلَا","يَسْتَطِيعُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"كَشَفَ"}}]